<title>USA: Willmar, Minn., won by Norwest Investment.</title>
<headline>Willmar, Minn., won by Norwest Investment.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwest Investment Services said it won $1.265 million of Willmar, Minn., general obligation improvement bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 4.74 percent.</p>
</text>
